      "name": "media",
      "description": {
        "content": "Media library. `X-WP-Total` reports 43 attachments; anonymous enumeration returns fewer (see the listMedia description).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "3fe51b06-4b65-4e3f-b210-17c3a506d2d6",
          "name": "List media library attachments",
          "request": {
            "name": "List media library attachments",
            "description": {
              "content": "Lists media attachments. This collection has a documented counting anomaly on this deployment: `X-WP-Total` consistently reports 43 and `X-WP-TotalPages` is computed from it, but the anonymous result set is always smaller than the requested page — observed 2026-08-09 as 0 items for `per_page=1`, 2 for `per_page=5`, 7 for `per_page=10` and 26 for `per_page=100`. Roughly 17 attachments are counted by the header but filtered out of the anonymous response, so `X-WP-Total` must not be trusted as the retrievable item count and a client must page to exhaustion rather than relying on `X-WP-TotalPages`. Observed MIME types across the 26 retrievable items: 13 image/jpeg, 11 image/png, 1 video/mp4, 1 empty.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
